---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { catalog } from "../lib/catalog";
const changes = [...new Map(catalog.items.flatMap(item => item.changes.map(change => [change.id, { ...change, name: item.name, title: item.title }] as const))).values()].sort((a, b) => b.date.localeCompare(a.date) || b.id.localeCompare(a.id));
---
<Base title="Changelog"><article class="prose-page"><h1>The work keeps moving.</h1><p>Changes from the library’s ledger, with the component they affect. Read the source before bringing an update into code you have changed locally.</p>{changes.map(change => <section class="changelog-entry" id={change.id}><time datetime={change.date}>{change.date}</time><h2><a href={`/components/${change.name}/`}>{change.title}</a> · {change.kind}</h2><p>{change.summary}</p></section>)}</article></Base>
